  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The proposed single storey rear extension would by reason of its excessive depth cause harm to neighbours' living conditions, through loss of light and outlook.  The front canopy extension would by reason of its excessive bulk, height and design, represent an obtrusive development, harmful to the character of the original property and street scene and unbalancing the appearance of this symmetrically designed pair of semi detached houses, contrary to policies ENV-B.1.1 (New Development) and H.6.4 (Extensions and Alterations) of the Adopted Unitary Development Plan and Sections 1.0 (Single Storey Rear Extensions & Conservatories) and 6.0 (Front Extensions & Porches) of the Residential Extension Guidelines."
